    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/854d77118d4416813d5e41cb981c22d5.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deer Crusade is a 2D Metroidvania adventure where exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving guide the journey home. Take the role of a cursed child searching for scattered gem shards across a vast, mysterious world inspired by Mayan mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful abilities, face off against challenging bosses, and uncover hidden secrets in a handcrafted world rich with environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/64fd39222e87bf174d7a7bfda5384edd.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/061cc54ca86a6a701caaa8fbe45d5b73.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From intense battles to quiet moments of discovery, Deer Crusade invites you into a journey that\u2019s as challenging as it is unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/4ac5807a9265443808f474b4e26edf93.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/bcf4f2091e30205f6efb55b772fe1972.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/854d77118d4416813d5e41cb981c22d5.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deer Crusade is a 2D Metroidvania adventure where exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving guide the journey home. Take the role of a cursed child searching for scattered gem shards across a vast, mysterious world inspired by Mayan mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful abilities, face off against challenging bosses, and uncover hidden secrets in a handcrafted world rich with environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/64fd39222e87bf174d7a7bfda5384edd.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/061cc54ca86a6a701caaa8fbe45d5b73.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From intense battles to quiet moments of discovery, Deer Crusade invites you into a journey that\u2019s as challenging as it is unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/4ac5807a9265443808f474b4e26edf93.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/bcf4f2091e30205f6efb55b772fe1972.avif?t=1751676263\" /></span></p>",
